  "description": "Umbraco Search provider for WarpSearch (https://warpsearch.io/), the fast, affordable serverless search service. Your Umbraco content, media and member indexes live in WarpSearch instead of local Examine (Lucene) indexes on your web servers, with full-text relevance, filters, multi-select facets, sorting, culture and segment variants and protected content. No search cluster to run, one shared index for load-balanced sites, and it runs on WarpSearch's free plan.",
